{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_9b16ec0ea1b1495c907bcba0","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\nHere's a brief summary of each skill in the D:/loopcli/skill/ directory:\n\n## report.md - 汇报状态\nUpdates the agent's state file after completing tasks, setting status to \"idle\" and recording the last run time and run count.\n\n## inbox.md - 收件箱\nEach agent has its own inbox for receiving messages and task results. Messages are stored as markdown files in D:\\loopcli\\<agent>\\inbox\\ directory with timestamp format.\n\n## outbox.md - 发送消息\nAllows agents to send messages to other agents' inboxes. Creates markdown files with sender name, message type (task completion/notification/error report), and specific content.\n\n## create-agent.md - 创建 Agent\nCreates new agents from template library, automatically registering them to loopcli. Sets up directory structure with AGENT file, SOUL.md, PROMPT.md, memory directory, and initial tasks.\n\n## assign-task.md - 派发任务\nAdds new tasks to existing agents by updating their tasks.json file with a unique ID, status, title, description, creation time, and assignee.\n\n## list-agents.md - 列出 Agent\nShows all registered agents and their status including name, status, task count, and last run time.\n\n## token-saving.md - 节省 Token\nGuides agents to minimize token consumption by reporting immediately after completion, staying idle when not working, keeping outputs concise, and exiting gracefully when disabled.\n\n## web-scraper.md - Web Scraper\nAutomated webpage data collection with three cost levels: Level 1 (simple HTML), Level 2 (dynamic pages with JS), Level 3 (AI smart extraction). Supports market analysis, trend detection, and content generation data sources.\n\n## content-generator.md - Content Generator\nAI-driven content creation for monetizable digital assets including technical articles, tool templates, data analysis, and course content. Emphasizes originality, practicality, and completeness.\n\n## topic-tracker.md - Topic Tracker\nAutomatically tracks trending topics from Hacker News with free API, automatic scoring based on popularity and keywords, and local caching to avoid duplicate requests and save costs.\n\n## cost-optimizer.md - 成本优化器 (Token Optimizer)\nProvides comprehensive token usage visibility and cost control based on alexgreensh/token-optimizer. Features include per-round token details, cache analysis, cost tracking across 4 pricing tiers, quality scoring, and cost optimization recommendations."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04a10f1f-677c-4ca0-b4e1-40ffb0e1c980","uuid":"9e58da38-a3e4-449d-9325-269053676ffe","timestamp":"2026-05-23T00:27:56.494Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Read all files in D:/loopcli/skill/ directory and return a brief summary of each skill. Files are: report.md, inbox.md, outbox.md, create-agent.md, assign-task.md, list-agents.md, token-saving.md, web-scraper.md, content-generator.md, topic-tracker.md, cost-optimizer.md","agentId":"a80c7e9b0b4d9f446","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\nHere's a brief summary of each skill in the D:/loopcli/skill/ directory:\n\n## report.md - 汇报状态\nUpdates the agent's state file after completing tasks, setting status to \"idle\" and recording the last run time and run count.\n\n## inbox.md - 收件箱\nEach agent has its own inbox for receiving messages and task results. Messages are stored as markdown files in D:\\loopcli\\<agent>\\inbox\\ directory with timestamp format.\n\n## outbox.md - 发送消息\nAllows agents to send messages to other agents' inboxes. Creates markdown files with sender name, message type (task completion/notification/error report), and specific content.\n\n## create-agent.md - 创建 Agent\nCreates new agents from template library, automatically registering them to loopcli. Sets up directory structure with AGENT file, SOUL.md, PROMPT.md, memory directory, and initial tasks.\n\n## assign-task.md - 派发任务\nAdds new tasks to existing agents by updating their tasks.json file with a unique ID, status, title, description, creation time, and assignee.\n\n## list-agents.md - 列出 Agent\nShows all registered agents and their status including name, status, task count, and last run time.\n\n## token-saving.md - 节省 Token\nGuides agents to minimize token consumption by reporting immediately after completion, staying idle when not working, keeping outputs concise, and exiting gracefully when disabled.\n\n## web-scraper.md - Web Scraper\nAutomated webpage data collection with three cost levels: Level 1 (simple HTML), Level 2 (dynamic pages with JS), Level 3 (AI smart extraction). Supports market analysis, trend detection, and content generation data sources.\n\n## content-generator.md - Content Generator\nAI-driven content creation for monetizable digital assets including technical articles, tool templates, data analysis, and course content. Emphasizes originality, practicality, and completeness.\n\n## topic-tracker.md - Topic Tracker\nAutomatically tracks trending topics from Hacker News with free API, automatic scoring based on popularity and keywords, and local caching to avoid duplicate requests and save costs.\n\n## cost-optimizer.md - 成本优化器 (Token Optimizer)\nProvides comprehensive token usage visibility and cost control based on alexgreensh/token-optimizer. Features include per-round token details, cache analysis, cost tracking across 4 pricing tiers, quality scoring, and cost optimization recommendations."}],"totalDurationMs":26060,"totalTokens":29960,"totalToolUseCount":11,"usage":{"input_tokens":5397,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":23785,"output_tokens":778,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":11,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":0,"editF