{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_93f8a0e0cce844648f8178e3","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\nHere's a summary of each skill's purpose and usage:\n\n## Summary of LoopCLI Skills\n\n### 1. **report.md** - Status Reporting\n- **Purpose**: Updates agent status after completing tasks\n- **Usage**: Modifies the agent's `state.json` file with status (idle), last run time, and run count\n- **Format**: Updates with `{status: \"idle\", last_run: \"<timestamp>\", run_count: \"<increment>\"}`\n\n### 2. **inbox.md** - Inbox Management\n- **Purpose**: Each agent has its own inbox for receiving messages and task results\n- **Location**: `D:\\loopcli\\<agent_name>\\inbox\\`\n- **Usage**: Messages are written as `<sender>_<timestamp>.md` files\n- **Format**: Includes message type (task result/notification/collaboration request) and content\n\n### 3. **outbox.md** - Messaging System\n- **Purpose**: Send messages to other agents' inboxes\n- **Usage**: Write to target agent's inbox directory\n- **Format**: `# From <your_name>` with type (task completion/notification/error report) and content\n\n### 4. **create-agent.md** - Agent Creation\n- **Purpose**: Create new agents from templates in the template library\n- **Usage**: `loopcli create <template_id> --task \"task_description\"`\n- **Features**: Automatically creates directory structure with AGENT marker, SOUL.md, PROMPT.md, memory/tasks.json, memory/state.json, and log/run.md\n\n### 5. **assign-task.md** - Task Assignment\n- **Purpose**: Add new tasks to existing agents\n- **Usage**: `loopcli task <agent_directory> \"task_title\" --desc \"task_description\"`\n- **Process**: Updates the agent's tasks.json with new task having auto-incrementing ID\n\n### 6. **list-agents.md** - Agent Listing\n- **Purpose**: View all registered agents and their status\n- **Usage**: `loopcli list`\n- **Output**: Shows each agent's name, status, task count, and last run time\n\n### 7. **token-saving.md** - Token Conservation\n- **Purpose**: Minimize token consumption across the system\n- **Rules**: \n  - Report results immediately after task completion\n  - Output IDLE when idle, don't explore autonomously\n  - Keep outputs concise, avoid redundant information\n  - Exit normally when disabled (AGENT file contains \"disabled\")\n\n### 8. **web-scraper.md** - Web Scraping\n- **Purpose**: Automated web data collection for market analysis, trend detection, and content generation\n- **Cost Levels**:\n  - Level 1 (100-500 tokens): Simple HTML parsing\n  - Level 2 (500-2000 tokens): Dynamic pages with JS execution\n  - Level 3 (2000-5000 tokens): AI-driven extraction\n- **Usage**: `loopcli scrape <URL> --level 1-3 --output json/csv`\n- **Technologies**: BeautifulSoup (low), Playwright (medium), ScrapeGraphAI (high)\n\n### 9. **content-generator.md** - Content Generation\n- **Purpose**: AI-driven content creation for monetizable digital assets\n- **Value Directions**: Technical articles, tool templates, data analysis, course content\n- **Usage**: `loopcli generate <type> --topic \"topic\" --output markdown/pdf`\n- **Quality Standards**: Originality, practicality, completeness\n- **Monetization**: Technical blogs, GitHub, paid courses, SaaS tools\n\n### 10. **topic-tracker.md** - Topic Tracking\n- **Purpose**: Automatically track hot topics for content generation\n- **Features**: Hacker News API, automatic scoring, local caching\n- **Usage**: Run Python script in content-generator directory\n- **Output**: Saves to `content-generator/memory/cache/topics.json`\n- **Cost**: Zero (uses free APIs)\n\n### 11. **cost-optimizer.md** - Cost Optimization\n- **Purpose**: Based on alexgreensh/token-optimizer for complete token visibility and cost control\n- **Features**: Token breakdown per round, cache analysis, cost tracking across 4 pricing tiers, quality scoring\n- **Installation**: Clone repository or install via plugin marketplace\n- **Usage**: `python3 measure.py setup-daemon` or `python3 measure.py dashboard --serve`\n- **Value**: Detects runtime (15-25%) and structural (75-85%) token waste\n\nThese skills form a comprehensive multi-agent system with task management, communication, content generation, web scraping, and cost optimization capabilities."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05b3e228-d28c-4e13-abc4-e1f635ffca3b","uuid":"b5f834d6-ed6c-4dda-a08e-7ba549d26934","timestamp":"2026-05-23T00:31:03.321Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Read all skill files in D:/loopcli/skill/ directory and return their contents. Files to read:\n- D:/loopcli/skill/report.md\n- D:/loopcli/skill/inbox.md\n- D:/loopcli/skill/outbox.md\n- D:/loopcli/skill/create-agent.md\n- D:/loopcli/skill/assign-task.md\n- D:/loopcli/skill/list-agents.md\n- D:/loopcli/skill/token-saving.md\n- D:/loopcli/skill/web-scraper.md\n- D:/loopcli/skill/content-generator.md\n- D:/loopcli/skill/topic-tracker.md\n- D:/loopcli/skill/cost-optimizer.md\n\nReturn a brief summary of each skill's purpose and usage.","agentId":"a5763d3f655cf8b51","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\nHere's a summary of each skill's purpose and usage:\n\n## Summary of LoopCLI Skills\n\n### 1. **report.md** - Status Reporting\n- **Purpose**: Updates agent status after completing tasks\n- **Usage**: Modifies the agent's `state.json` file with status (idle), last run time, and run count\n- **Format**: Updates with `{status: \"idle\", last_run: \"<timestamp>\", run_count: \"<increment>\"}`\n\n### 2. **inbox.md** - Inbox Management\n- **Purpose**: Each agent has its own inbox for receiving messages and task results\n- **Location**: `D:\\loopcli\\<agent_name>\\inbox\\`\n- **Usage**: Messages are written as `<sender>_<timestamp>.md` files\n- **Format**: Includes message type (task result/notification/collaboration request) and content\n\n### 3. **outbox.md** - Messaging System\n- **Purpose**: Send messages to other agents' inboxes\n- **Usage**: Write to target agent's inbox directory\n- **Format**: `# From <your_name>` with type (task completion/notification/error report) and content\n\n### 4. **create-agent.md** - Agent Creation\n- **Purpose**: Create new agents from templates in the template library\n- **Usage**: `loopcli create <template_id> --task \"task_description\"`\n- **Features**: Automatically creates directory structure with AGENT marker, SOUL.md, PROMPT.md, memory/tasks.json, memory/state.json, and log/run.md\n\n### 5. **assign-task.md** - Task Assignment\n- **Purpose**: Add new tasks to existing agents\n- **Usage**: `loopcli task <agent_directory> \"task_title\" --desc \"task_description\"`\n- **Process**: Updates the agent's tasks.json with new task having auto-incrementing ID\n\n### 6. **list-agents.md** - Agent Listing\n- **Purpose**: View all registered agents and their status\n- **Usage**: `loopcli list`\n- **Output**: Shows each agent's name, status, task count, and last run time\n\n### 7. **token-saving.md** - Token Conservation\n- **Purpose**: Minimize token consumption across the system\n- **Rules**: \n  - Report results immediately after task completion\n  - Output IDLE when idle, don't explore autonomously\n  - Keep outputs concise, avoid redundant information\n  - Exit normally when disabled (AGENT file contains \"disabled\")\n\n### 8. **web-scraper.md** - Web Scraping\n- **Purpose**: Automated web data collection for market analysis, trend detection, and content generation\n- **Cost Levels**:\n  - Level 1 (100-500 tokens): Simple HTML parsing\n  - Level 2 (500-2000 tokens): Dynamic pages with JS execution\n  - Level 3 (2000-5000 tokens): AI-driven extraction\n- **Usage**: `loopcli scrape <URL> --level 1-3 --output json/csv`\n- **Technologies**: BeautifulSoup (low), Playwright (medium), ScrapeGraphAI (high)\n\n### 9. **content-generator.md** - Content Generation\n- **Purpose**: AI-driven content creation for monetizable digital assets\n- **Value Directions**: Technical articles, tool templates, data analysis, course content\n- **Usage**: `loopcli generate <type> --topic \"topic\" --output markdown/pdf`\n- **Quality Standards**: Originality, practicality, completeness\n- **Monetization**: Technical blogs, GitHub, paid courses, SaaS tools\n\n### 10. **topic-tracker.md** - Topic Tracking\n- **Purpose**: Automatically track hot topics for content generation\n- **Features**: Hacker News API, automatic scoring, local caching\n- **Usage**: Run Python script in content-generator directory\n- **Output**: Saves to `content-generator/memory/cache/topics.json`\n- **Cost**: Zero (uses free APIs)\n\n### 11. **cost-optimizer.md** - Cost Optimization\n- **Purpose**: Based on alexgreensh/token-optimizer for complete token visibility and cost control\n- **Features**: Token breakdown per round, cache analysis, cost tracking across 4 pricing tiers, quality scoring\n- **Installation**: Clone repository or install via plugin marketplace\n- **Usage**: `python3 measure.py setup-daemon` or `python3 measure.py dashboard --serve`\n- **Value**: Detects runtime (15-25%) and structural (75-85%) token waste\n\nThese skills form a comprehensive multi-agent system with task management, communication, content generation, web scraping, and cost optimization capabilities."}],"totalDurationMs":54315,"totalTokens":30857,"totalToolUseCount":11,"usage":{"input_tokens":946,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28401,"output_tokens":1510,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":11,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
