{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605230831532714f42c9ba8436e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good - the project is only 283KB, well under the 4MB limit. Now let me plan and execute the task items:\n\n1. **Generate 1024x1024 app icon** - Create an SVG icon and an HTML tool to render it to PNG via canvas\n2. **Prepare 3-5 promotional screenshots** - Create an HTML screenshot generator tool\n3. **Write privacy policy page** - Create privacy-policy.html\n4. **Adapt 穿山甲 SDK real integration code** - Update AdManager.js with configurable ad unit IDs and proper SDK integration\n5. **JS/CSS compression** - Create a build script to minify all JS\n6. **Check game.json and project.config.json** - Update configurations\n\nLet me start working on these items. I'll do multiple things in parallel where possible.\n\nLet me start by creating all the necessary files. I'll work through each item:\n\n### 1. App Icon (1024x1024)\nI'll create an HTML tool that generates the icon using Canvas API, and also create an SVG version.\n\n### 2. Promotional Screenshots\nI'll create an HTML tool that generates promotional screenshots.\n\n### 3. Privacy Policy\nCreate a privacy-policy.html page.\n\n### 4. 穿山甲 SDK Real Integration\nUpdate AdManager.js with:\n- Configurable ad unit IDs (via a config object)\n- Real SDK initialization with error handling\n- Ad loading states\n\n### 5. JS/CSS Compression\nCreate a build script that minifies all JS files.\n\n### 6. game.json and project.config.json\nUpdate with complete configuration.\n\nLet me start creating the files.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05b3e228-d28c-4e13-abc4-e1f635ffca3b","uuid":"00d28902-42ec-45df-9288-4c21fa142762"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605230831532714f42c9ba8436e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"text","text":"项目仅 283KB，远小于 4MB 限制。开始逐项执行任务。\n\n先并行创建多个文件：应用图标工具、隐私政策、构建脚本。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05b3e228-d28c-4e13-abc4-e1f635ffca3b","uuid":"046027d7-0ea8-40dc-8fe1-a161bd3a855a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605230831532714f42c9ba8436e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_b144c65f52eb460bbc3f2155","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\tools\\generate-icon.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>消消消大作战 — 应用图标生成器</title>\n  <style>\n    body { background: #222; color: #FFF; font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }\n    canvas { border: 2px solid #555; margin: 20px; }\n    button { padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 16px; background: #FF6B6B; color: #FFF; border: none; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; margin: 8px; }\n    button:hover { background: #FF4757; }\n    .hint { color: #999; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h2>消消消大作战 — 应用图标生成器 (1024x1024)</h2>\n  <canvas id=\"iconCanvas\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"></canvas>\n  <br>\n  <button onclick=\"generateIcon()\">生成图标</button>\n  <button onclick=\"downloadIcon()\">下载 PNG</button>\n  <p class=\"hint\">点击\"下载 PNG\"保存为 icon.png，用于抖音小游戏提审</p>\n\n  <script>\n    function generateIcon() {\n      const canvas = document.getElementById('iconCanvas');\n      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n      const S = 1024;\n      const cx = S / 2, cy = S / 2;\n\n      // Background gradient (warm orange to red)\n      const bgGrad = ctx.createRadialGradient(cx, cy, 0, cx, cy, S * 0.7);\n      bgGrad.addColorStop(0, '#FFF176');\n      bgGrad.addColorStop(0.5, '#FFB74D');\n      bgGrad.addColorStop(1, '#E53935');\n      ctx.fillStyle = bgGrad;\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, S, S);\n\n      // Decorative burst rays\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.translate(cx, cy);\n      for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\n        ctx.rotate(Math.PI / 6);\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.moveTo(0, 0);\n        ctx.lineTo(-40, -S * 0.7);\n        ctx.lineTo(40, -S * 0.7);\n        ctx.closePath();\n        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.08)';\n        ctx.fill();\n      }\n      ctx.restore();\n\n      // Main fruit circle\n      const fruitR = 280;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.arc(cx, cy - 40, fruitR, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      const fruitGrad = ctx.createRadialGradient(cx - 60, cy - 100, 20, cx, cy - 40, fruitR);\n      fruitGrad.addColorStop(0, '#FF8A80');\n      fruitGrad.addColorStop(0.7, '#D32F2F');\n      fruitGrad.addColorStop(1, '#B71C1C');\n      ctx.fillStyle = fruitGrad;\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      // Apple highlight\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.arc(cx - 80, cy - 140, 80, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.25)';\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      // Apple stem\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(cx, cy - 40 - fruitR + 20);\n      ctx.quadraticCurveTo(cx + 30, cy - 40 - fruitR - 40, cx + 15, cy - 40 - fruitR - 60);\n      ctx.lineWidth = 8;\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#5D4037';\n      ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n      ctx.stroke();\n\n      // Apple leaf\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.ellipse(cx + 35, cy - 40 - fruitR - 20, 35, 18, 0.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#4CAF50';\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      // Shine dots\n      const shineColors = ['#FF6B6B', '#FFD93D', '#6BCB77', '#4D96FF', '#9B59B6', '#FF8C00'];\n      const positions = [\n        [cx - 200, cy + 180], [cx + 200, cy + 180],\n        [cx - 300, cy + 60], [cx + 300, cy + 60],\n        [cx - 150, cy + 320], [cx + 150, cy + 320],\n      ];\n      positions.forEach((pos, i) => {\n        const r = 35;\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(pos[0], pos[1], r, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        const g = ctx.createRadialGradient(pos[0] - 8, pos[1] - 8, 2, pos[0], pos[1], r);\n        g.addColorStop(0, '#FFF');\n        g.addColorStop(0.4, shineColors[i]);\n        g.addColorStop(1, shineColors[i] + '88');\n        ctx.fillStyle = g;\n        ctx.fill();\n      });\n\n      // Sparkle stars\n      function drawStar(x, y, size, color) {\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.translate(x, y);\n        ctx.fillStyle = color;\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n          ctx.rotate(Math.PI / 4);\n          ctx.moveTo(0, 0);\n          ctx.lineTo(-size * 0.15, -size);\n          ctx.lineTo(0, -size * 0.6);\n          ctx.lineTo(size * 0.15, -size);\n        }\n        ctx.fill();\n        ctx.restore();\n      }\n      drawStar(cx - 340, cy - 200, 25, '#FFF9C4');\n      drawStar(cx + 340, cy - 250, 18, '#FFF9C4');\n      drawStar(cx + 260, cy - 100, 15, '#FFF9C4');\n      drawStar(cx - 280, cy + 260, 20, '#FFF9C4');\n\n      // Title text\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#B71C1C';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 8;\n      ctx.font = 'bold 120px \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n\n      // Text shadow\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.2)';\n      ctx.fillText('消消消大作战', cx + 4, cy + 400 + 4);\n\n      // Main text\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.strokeText('消消消大作战', cx, cy + 400);\n      ctx.fillText('消消消大作战', cx, cy + 400);\n\n      // Subtitle\n      ctx.font = 'bold 40px \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF176';\n      ctx.fillText('Match & Blast', cx, cy + 470);\n    }\n\n    function downloadIcon() {\n      const canvas = document.getElementById('iconCanvas');\n      const link = document.createElement('a');\n      link.download = 'icon.png';\n      link.href = canvas.toDataURL('image/png');\n      link.click();\n    }\n\n    generateIcon();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05b3e228-d28c-4e13-abc4-e1f635ffca3b","uuid":"3935b689-f2e2-4931-bb61-1cb9919a5db4"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605230831532714f42c9ba8436e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_52381c12774848509dd866fd","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\tools\\generate-screenshots.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>消消消大作战 — 宣传截图生成器</title>\n  <style>\n    body { background: #222; color: #FFF; font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }\n    .screenshots { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }\n    canvas { border: 2px solid #555; border-radius: 8px; }\n    .shot-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }\n    .shot-label { margin: 8px 0; color: #CCC; font-size: 14px; }\n    button { padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 16px; background: #6BCB77; color: #FFF; border: none; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; margin: 4px; }\n    button:hover { background: #4CAF50; }\n    .hint { color: #999; font-size: 14px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h2>消消消大作战 — 宣传截图生成器</h2>\n  <p class=\"hint\">生成抖音小游戏提审所需的宣传截图 (1280x720 横屏)</p>\n  <div class=\"screenshots\" id=\"container\"></div>\n  <button onclick=\"downloadAll()\">全部下载</button>\n\n  <script>\n    const SHOTS = [\n      { label: '截图1：主界面', desc: '展示游戏主菜单', id: 's1' },\n      { label: '截图2：核心玩法', desc: '展示三消棋盘', id: 's2' },\n      { label: '截图3：连锁特效', desc: '展示连锁消除', id: 's3' },\n      { label: '截图4：关卡地图', desc: '展示地图界面', id: 's4' },\n      { label: '截图5：社交互动', desc: '展示好友PK', id: 's5' },\n    ];\n\n    const container = document.getElementById('container');\n    SHOTS.forEach(shot => {\n      const card = document.createElement('div');\n      card.className = 'shot-card';\n      const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');\n      canvas.id = shot.id;\n      canvas.width = 1280;\n      canvas.height = 720;\n      card.appendChild(canvas);\n      const label = document.createElement('div');\n      label.className = 'shot-label';\n      label.textContent = shot.label;\n      card.appendChild(label);\n      const btn = document.createElement('button');\n      btn.textContent = '下载';\n      btn.onclick = () => downloadCanvas(canvas, shot.label);\n      card.appendChild(btn);\n      container.appendChild(card);\n    });\n\n    const W = 1280, H = 720;\n    const FRUIT_COLORS = ['#FF6B6B', '#FFD93D', '#9B59B6', '#4D96FF', '#FF8C00', '#6BCB77'];\n    const FRUIT_EMOJIS = ['🍎', '🍌', '🍇', '🫐', '🍊', '🥝'];\n\n    function drawBackground(ctx, type) {\n      const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, W, H);\n      if (type === 'menu') {\n        grad.addColorStop(0, '#667eea'); grad.addColorStop(1, '#764ba2');\n      } else if (type === 'game') {\n        grad.addColorStop(0, '#f093fb'); grad.addColorStop(1, '#f5576c');\n      } else if (type === 'map') {\n        grad.addColorStop(0, '#4facfe'); grad.addColorStop(1, '#00f2fe');\n      } else if (type === 'social') {\n        grad.addColorStop(0, '#43e97b'); grad.addColorStop(1, '#38f9d7');\n      } else {\n        grad.addColorStop(0, '#fa709a'); grad.addColorStop(1, '#fee140');\n      }\n      ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);\n    }\n\n    function drawBoard(ctx, ox, oy, cellSize, board) {\n      const N = board.length;\n      // Board background\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.2)';\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.roundRect(ox - 8, oy - 8, N * cellSize + 16, N * cellSize + 16, 12);\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      for (let r = 0; r < N; r++) {\n        for (let c = 0; c < N; c++) {\n          const x = ox + c * cellSize;\n          const y = oy + r * cellSize;\n          const v = board[r][c];\n          if (v < 0) continue;\n          // Cell bg\n          ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.15)';\n          ctx.beginPath();\n          ctx.roundRect(x + 2, y + 2, cellSize - 4, cellSize - 4, 6);\n          ctx.fill();\n          // Fruit\n          ctx.font = `${cellSize * 0.7}px sans-serif`;\n          ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n          ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n          ctx.fillText(FRUIT_EMOJIS[v], x + cellSize / 2, y + cellSize / 2);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    function makeBoard(pattern) {\n      const b = [];\n      for (let r = 0; r < 8; r++) {\n        b[r] = [];\n        for (let c = 0; c < 8; c++) {\n          if (pattern === 'chain' && r >= 2 && r <= 4 && c >= 2 && c <= 5) {\n            b[r][c] = 1; // yellow chain\n          } else {\n            b[r][c] = Math.floor(Math.random() * 6);\n          }\n        }\n      }\n      return b;\n    }\n\n    // Screenshot 1: Main menu\n    function drawS1() {\n      const ctx = document.getElementById('s1').getContext('2d');\n      drawBackground(ctx, 'menu');\n\n      // Title\n      ctx.font = 'bold 80px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.3)';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 4;\n      ctx.strokeText('消消消大作战', W / 2, 160);\n      ctx.fillText('消消消大作战', W / 2, 160);\n\n      ctx.font = '32px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF176';\n      ctx.fillText('Match & Blast', W / 2, 220);\n\n      // Play button\n      const btnW = 300, btnH = 80;\n      const btnX = (W - btnW) / 2, btnY = 320;\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FF6B6B';\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.roundRect(btnX, btnY, btnW, btnH, 40);\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 40px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('开始游戏', W / 2, btnY + 52);\n\n      // Daily bonus\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.roundRect(W / 2 - 140, 440, 280, 50, 25);\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#333';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 24px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('🎁 每日登录奖励', W / 2, 472);\n\n      // Decorative fruits\n      ctx.font = '60px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('🍎', 120, 500);\n      ctx.fillText('🍌', 1050, 450);\n      ctx.fillText('🍇', 200, 350);\n      ctx.fillText('🫐', 1000, 300);\n      ctx.fillText('🍊', 150, 200);\n      ctx.fillText('🥝', 1100, 200);\n\n      // Rating stars\n      ctx.font = '36px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐', W / 2, 560);\n\n      // Bottom\n      ctx.font = '20px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.6)';\n      ctx.fillText('超过100万玩家正在玩', W / 2, 620);\n    }\n\n    // Screenshot 2: Core gameplay\n    function drawS2() {\n      const ctx = document.getElementById('s2').getContext('2d');\n      drawBackground(ctx, 'game');\n\n      const board = makeBoard('normal');\n      const cellSize = 60;\n      const boardW = 8 * cellSize;\n      const ox = (W - boardW) / 2;\n      const oy = 120;\n      drawBoard(ctx, ox, oy, cellSize, board);\n\n      // HUD\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 28px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n      ctx.fillText('关卡 12', 40, 50);\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillText('分数: 3,250', W / 2, 50);\n      ctx.textAlign = 'right';\n      ctx.fillText('剩余步数: 15', W - 40, 50);\n\n      // Target\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.font = '24px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF176';\n      ctx.fillText('目标: 达到 5,000 分', W / 2, 90);\n\n      // Swipe hint arrow\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n      ctx.setLineDash([8, 4]);\n      const arrowX = ox + 2.5 * cellSize + cellSize / 2;\n      const arrowY = oy + 4.5 * cellSize + cellSize / 2;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(arrowX, arrowY);\n      ctx.lineTo(arrowX + cellSize, arrowY);\n      ctx.stroke();\n      ctx.setLineDash([]);\n\n      // Bottom buttons\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.2)';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(W / 2 - 250, 650, 120, 45, 22); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(W / 2 - 60, 650, 120, 45, 22); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(W / 2 + 130, 650, 120, 45, 22); ctx.fill();\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = '20px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('💡 提示', W / 2 - 190, 678);\n      ctx.fillText('🔄 重排', W / 2, 678);\n      ctx.fillText('➕ 加步', W / 2 + 190, 678);\n    }\n\n    // Screenshot 3: Chain reaction\n    function drawS3() {\n      const ctx = document.getElementById('s3').getContext('2d');\n      drawBackground(ctx, 'combo');\n\n      const board = makeBoard('chain');\n      const cellSize = 60;\n      const boardW = 8 * cellSize;\n      const ox = (W - boardW) / 2;\n      const oy = 100;\n      drawBoard(ctx, ox, oy, cellSize, board);\n\n      // Chain text\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 48px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.4)';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n      ctx.strokeText('3x 连锁！', W / 2, 620);\n      ctx.fillText('3x 连锁！', W / 2, 620);\n\n      // Score popup\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 36px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('+1,500 分', W / 2, 670);\n\n      // Sparkle effects around chain area\n      ctx.font = '30px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('✨', ox + 1 * cellSize, oy + 3 * cellSize);\n      ctx.fillText('✨', ox + 6 * cellSize, oy + 2 * cellSize);\n      ctx.fillText('💥', ox + 3 * cellSize, oy + 4 * cellSize + 30);\n\n      // Combo multiplier badge\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FF6B6B';\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.arc(W - 100, 60, 45, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 28px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('x2', W - 100, 68);\n    }\n\n    // Screenshot 4: Map screen\n    function drawS4() {\n      const ctx = document.getElementById('s4').getContext('2d');\n      drawBackground(ctx, 'map');\n\n      // Path\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 6;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      const path = [\n        [200, 600], [300, 520], [400, 480], [500, 400], [600, 350],\n        [700, 300], [800, 250], [900, 200], [1000, 180],\n      ];\n      ctx.moveTo(path[0][0], path[0][1]);\n      path.forEach(p => ctx.lineTo(p[0], p[1]));\n      ctx.stroke();\n\n      // Level nodes\n      const levels = [\n        { x: 200, y: 600, star: 3, done: true },\n        { x: 350, y: 500, star: 2, done: true },\n        { x: 500, y: 400, star: 3, done: true },\n        { x: 650, y: 320, star: 1, done: true },\n        { x: 800, y: 250, star: 0, done: false, current: true },\n        { x: 950, y: 190, star: 0, done: false, locked: true },\n        { x: 1080, y: 220, star: 0, done: false, locked: true },\n      ];\n\n      levels.forEach((lv, i) => {\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(lv.x, lv.y, 28, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n\n        if (lv.locked) {\n          ctx.fillStyle = '#666';\n        } else if (lv.current) {\n          ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n        } else {\n          ctx.fillStyle = '#6BCB77';\n        }\n        ctx.fill();\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#FFF';\n        ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n        ctx.stroke();\n\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n        ctx.font = 'bold 20px sans-serif';\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n        ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n        if (lv.locked) {\n          ctx.fillText('🔒', lv.x, lv.y);\n        } else {\n          ctx.fillText(`${i + 1}`, lv.x, lv.y);\n        }\n\n        if (lv.star > 0) {\n          ctx.font = '16px sans-serif';\n          ctx.fillText('⭐'.repeat(lv.star), lv.x, lv.y + 40);\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Title\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 40px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.textBaseline = 'alphabetic';\n      ctx.fillText('冒险地图', W / 2, 80);\n\n      // Coins\n      ctx.font = '24px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n      ctx.fillText('🪙 1,250', 40, 50);\n    }\n\n    // Screenshot 5: Social PK\n    function drawS5() {\n      const ctx = document.getElementById('s5').getContext('2d');\n      drawBackground(ctx, 'social');\n\n      // Title\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 40px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillText('好友 PK', W / 2, 60);\n\n      // VS layout\n      // Player 1\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.15)';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(40, 100, 540, 500, 16); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 32px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('你', 310, 160);\n      ctx.font = 'bold 60px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('😎', 310, 250);\n\n      // Player 1 score\n      ctx.font = 'bold 48px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n      ctx.fillText('4 / 5', 310, 340);\n\n      // Player 1 progress bar\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.2)';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(140, 370, 340, 20, 10); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#6BCB77';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(140, 370, 340 * 0.8, 20, 10); ctx.fill();\n\n      // VS badge\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FF6B6B';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(W / 2, 350, 50, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 36px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('VS', W / 2, 360);\n\n      // Player 2\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.15)';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(700, 100, 540, 500, 16); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 32px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('好友', 970, 160);\n      ctx.font = 'bold 60px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('🤗', 970, 250);\n\n      ctx.font = 'bold 48px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n      ctx.fillText('3 / 5', 970, 340);\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.2)';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(800, 370, 340, 20, 10); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FF6B6B';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(800, 370, 340 * 0.6, 20, 10); ctx.fill();\n\n      // Bottom\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = '24px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('🎉 你赢了！获得 50 金币 + 20 PK积分', W / 2, 660);\n    }\n\n    function downloadCanvas(canvas, label) {\n      const link = document.createElement('a');\n      link.download = `${label}.png`;\n      link.href = canvas.toDataURL('image/png');\n      link.click();\n    }\n\n    function downloadAll() {\n      SHOTS.forEach(shot => {\n        const canvas = document.getElementById(shot.id);\n        downloadCanvas(canvas, shot.label);\n      });\n    }\n\n    // Generate all screenshots\n    drawS1();\n    drawS2();\n    drawS3();\n    drawS4();\n    drawS5();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05b3e228-d28c-4e13-abc4-e1f635ffca3b","uuid":"3da23726-6913-4540-8c25-3b20cfdfe58c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605230831532714f42c9ba8436e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_19959a1e665546ce8e6b1fe2","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\privacy-policy.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>隐私政策 — 消消消大作战</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n      max-width: 800px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 20px;\n      background: #FFF8E7;\n      color: #333;\n      line-height: 1.8;\n    }\n    h1 { color: #D32F2F; text-align: center; font-size: 28px; }\n    h2 { color: #E53935; border-bottom: 2px solid #FFCDD2; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px; }\n    .update-date { text-align: center; color: #666; margin: 10px 0 30px; }\n    p { margin: 12px 0; }\n    ul { margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 24px; }\n    li { margin: 6px 0; }\n    .contact { background: #FFF3E0; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 20px; }\n    .footer { text-align: center; color: #999; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EEE; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>消消消大作战 隐私政策</h1>\n  <p class=\"update-date\">更新日期：2026年5月23日 | 生效日期：2026年5月23日</p>\n\n  <p>欢迎您使用「消消消大作战」（以下简称\"本游戏\"）。我们深知个人信息对您的重要性，将以高度审慎的态度对待您的个人信息。本隐私政策将帮助您了解以下内容：</p>\n\n  <h2>一、我们收集的信息</h2>\n  <p>本游戏仅在您明确同意的情况下收集以下信息：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>设备信息</strong>：设备型号、操作系统版本，用于兼容性适配</li>\n    <li><strong>游戏数据</strong>：关卡进度、分数、金币，存储于您的设备本地（localStorage）</li>\n    <li><strong>广告数据</strong>：广告展示频率数据，由穿山甲SDK按其隐私政策独立处理</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p><strong>我们不收集</strong>：真实姓名、身份证号、手机号、通讯录、位置信息、照片。</p>\n\n  <h2>二、信息的使用</h2>\n  <p>我们收集的信息仅用于以下目的：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>提供游戏服务、保存您的游戏进度</li>\n    <li>优化游戏体验和性能</li>\n    <li>展示广告（由第三方广告平台提供）</li>\n    <li>保障游戏公平性和安全性</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>三、信息的存储</h2>\n  <p>您的游戏进度数据存储在您的设备本地（localStorage），不会上传至我们的服务器。当您清除本地缓存时，游戏进度可能丢失。</p>\n\n  <h2>四、第三方服务</h2>\n  <p>本游戏集成了以下第三方服务：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>穿山甲广告SDK</strong>：由字节跳动提供，用于展示广告。穿山甲SDK可能收集设备标识符用于广告投放。详情请参阅 <a href=\"https://www.csjplatform.com/privacy\">穿山甲隐私政策</a></li>\n    <li><strong>抖音开放平台</strong>：用于社交分享和好友互动功能</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>五、信息的共享</h2>\n  <p>我们不会将您的个人信息出售、交易或以其他方式转让给第三方，以下情况除外：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>获得您的明确同意后</li>\n    <li>根据法律法规或政府要求</li>\n    <li>与上述第三方服务提供者共享（仅限于提供服务所必需的信息）</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>六、您的权利</h2>\n  <p>您享有以下权利：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>查阅</strong>：您可以随时在游戏设置中查看本地存储的数据</li>\n    <li><strong>删除</strong>：您可以清除本地缓存来删除所有游戏数据</li>\n    <li><strong>撤回同意</strong>：您可以在系统设置中关闭广告个性化推荐</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>七、未成年人保护</h2>\n  <p>本游戏适合全年龄段用户。我们高度重视未成年人的个人信息保护：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>如您的年龄不满14周岁，请在监护人指导下阅读本政策</li>\n    <li>我们不会主动收集未成年人的个人敏感信息</li>\n    <li>监护人有权查阅、更正或删除未成年人的游戏数据</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>八、隐私政策的更新</h2>\n  <p>我们可能会不时更新本隐私政策。更新后的政策将在游戏内或本页面公布。重大变更将通过弹窗等方式通知您。</p>\n\n  <h2>九、联系我们</h2>\n  <div class=\"contact\">\n    <p>如您对本隐私政策有任何疑问、意见或建议，请通过以下方式联系我们：</p>\n    <p>电子邮箱：privacy@example.com</p>\n    <p>我们将在15个工作日内回复您的请求。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <p>消消消大作战（Match & Blast）&copy; 2026</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05b3e228-d28c-4e13-abc4-e1f635ffca3b","uuid":"b28f23ec-1397-4ce2-8b60-9677893a050f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_b144c65f52eb460bbc3f2155","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\tools\\generate-icon.html (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05b3e228-d28c-4e13-abc4-e1f635ffca3b","uuid":"4a7fb8a1-122a-4898-831f-d1c9d1b61d74","timestamp":"2026-05-23T00:33:49.470Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\tools\\generate-icon.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>消消消大作战 — 应用图标生成器</title>\n  <style>\n    body { background: #222; color: #FFF; font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }\n    canvas { border: 2px solid #555; margin: 20px; }\n    button { padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 16px; background: #FF6B6B; color: #FFF; border: none; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; margin: 8px; }\n    button:hover { background: #FF4757; }\n    .hint { color: #999; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h2>消消消大作战 — 应用图标生成器 (1024x1024)</h2>\n  <canvas id=\"iconCanvas\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"></canvas>\n  <br>\n  <button onclick=\"generateIcon()\">生成图标</button>\n  <button onclick=\"downloadIcon()\">下载 PNG</button>\n  <p class=\"hint\">点击\"下载 PNG\"保存为 icon.png，用于抖音小游戏提审</p>\n\n  <script>\n    function generateIcon() {\n      const canvas = document.getElementById('iconCanvas');\n      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n      const S = 1024;\n      const cx = S / 2, cy = S / 2;\n\n      // Background gradient (warm orange to red)\n      const bgGrad = ctx.createRadialGradient(cx, cy, 0, cx, cy, S * 0.7);\n      bgGrad.addColorStop(0, '#FFF176');\n      bgGrad.addColorStop(0.5, '#FFB74D');\n      bgGrad.addColorStop(1, '#E53935');\n      ctx.fillStyle = bgGrad;\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, S, S);\n\n      // Decorative burst rays\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.translate(cx, cy);\n      for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\n        ctx.rotate(Math.PI / 6);\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.moveTo(0, 0);\n        ctx.lineTo(-40, -S * 0.7);\n        ctx.lineTo(40, -S * 0.7);\n        ctx.closePath();\n        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.08)';\n        ctx.fill();\n      }\n      ctx.restore();\n\n      // Main fruit circle\n      const fruitR = 280;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.arc(cx, cy - 40, fruitR, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      const fruitGrad = ctx.createRadialGradient(cx - 60, cy - 100, 20, cx, cy - 40, fruitR);\n      fruitGrad.addColorStop(0, '#FF8A80');\n      fruitGrad.addColorStop(0.7, '#D32F2F');\n      fruitGrad.addColorStop(1, '#B71C1C');\n      ctx.fillStyle = fruitGrad;\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      // Apple highlight\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.arc(cx - 80, cy - 140, 80, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.25)';\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      // Apple stem\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(cx, cy - 40 - fruitR + 20);\n      ctx.quadraticCurveTo(cx + 30, cy - 40 - fruitR - 40, cx + 15, cy - 40 - fruitR - 60);\n      ctx.lineWidth = 8;\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#5D4037';\n      ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n      ctx.stroke();\n\n      // Apple leaf\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.ellipse(cx + 35, cy - 40 - fruitR - 20, 35, 18, 0.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#4CAF50';\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      // Shine dots\n      const shineColors = ['#FF6B6B', '#FFD93D', '#6BCB77', '#4D96FF', '#9B59B6', '#FF8C00'];\n      const positions = [\n        [cx - 200, cy + 180], [cx + 200, cy + 180],\n        [cx - 300, cy + 60], [cx + 300, cy + 60],\n        [cx - 150, cy + 320], [cx + 150, cy + 320],\n      ];\n      positions.forEach((pos, i) => {\n        const r = 35;\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(pos[0], pos[1], r, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        const g = ctx.createRadialGradient(pos[0] - 8, pos[1] - 8, 2, pos[0], pos[1], r);\n        g.addColorStop(0, '#FFF');\n        g.addColorStop(0.4, shineColors[i]);\n        g.addColorStop(1, shineColors[i] + '88');\n        ctx.fillStyle = g;\n        ctx.fill();\n      });\n\n      // Sparkle stars\n      function drawStar(x, y, size, color) {\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.translate(x, y);\n        ctx.fillStyle = color;\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n          ctx.rotate(Math.PI / 4);\n          ctx.moveTo(0, 0);\n          ctx.lineTo(-size * 0.15, -size);\n          ctx.lineTo(0, -size * 0.6);\n          ctx.lineTo(size * 0.15, -size);\n        }\n        ctx.fill();\n        ctx.restore();\n      }\n      drawStar(cx - 340, cy - 200, 25, '#FFF9C4');\n      drawStar(cx + 340, cy - 250, 18, '#FFF9C4');\n      drawStar(cx + 260, cy - 100, 15, '#FFF9C4');\n      drawStar(cx - 280, cy + 260, 20, '#FFF9C4');\n\n      // Title text\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#B71C1C';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 8;\n      ctx.font = 'bold 120px \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n\n      // Text shadow\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.2)';\n      ctx.fillText('消消消大作战', cx + 4, cy + 400 + 4);\n\n      // Main text\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.strokeText('消消消大作战', cx, cy + 400);\n      ctx.fillText('消消消大作战', cx, cy + 400);\n\n      // Subtitle\n      ctx.font = 'bold 40px \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF176';\n      ctx.fillText('Match & Blast', cx, cy + 470);\n    }\n\n    function downloadIcon() {\n      const canvas = document.getElementById('iconCanvas');\n      const link = document.createElement('a');\n      link.download = 'icon.png';\n      link.href = canvas.toDataURL('image/png');\n      link.click();\n    }\n\n    generateIcon();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_52381c12774848509dd866fd","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\tools\\generate-screenshots.html (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05b3e228-d28c-4e13-abc4-e1f635ffca3b","uuid":"9be2ebeb-757d-40c1-9632-cb6091217cda","timestamp":"2026-05-23T00:33:50.289Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\tools\\generate-screenshots.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>消消消大作战 — 宣传截图生成器</title>\n  <style>\n    body { background: #222; color: #FFF; font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }\n    .screenshots { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }\n    canvas { border: 2px solid #555; border-radius: 8px; }\n    .shot-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }\n    .shot-label { margin: 8px 0; color: #CCC; font-size: 14px; }\n    button { padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 16px; background: #6BCB77; color: #FFF; border: none; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; margin: 4px; }\n    button:hover { background: #4CAF50; }\n    .hint { color: #999; font-size: 14px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h2>消消消大作战 — 宣传截图生成器</h2>\n  <p class=\"hint\">生成抖音小游戏提审所需的宣传截图 (1280x720 横屏)</p>\n  <div class=\"screenshots\" id=\"container\"></div>\n  <button onclick=\"downloadAll()\">全部下载</button>\n\n  <script>\n    const SHOTS = [\n      { label: '截图1：主界面', desc: '展示游戏主菜单', id: 's1' },\n      { label: '截图2：核心玩法', desc: '展示三消棋盘', id: 's2' },\n      { label: '截图3：连锁特效', desc: '展示连锁消除', id: 's3' },\n      { label: '截图4：关卡地图', desc: '展示地图界面', id: 's4' },\n      { label: '截图5：社交互动', desc: '展示好友PK', id: 's5' },\n    ];\n\n    const container = document.getElementById('container');\n    SHOTS.forEach(shot => {\n      const card = document.createElement('div');\n      card.className = 'shot-card';\n      const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');\n      canvas.id = shot.id;\n      canvas.width = 1280;\n      canvas.height = 720;\n      card.appendChild(canvas);\n      const label = document.createElement('div');\n      label.className = 'shot-label';\n      label.textContent = shot.label;\n      card.appendChild(label);\n      const btn = document.createElement('button');\n      btn.textContent = '下载';\n      btn.onclick = () => downloadCanvas(canvas, shot.label);\n      card.appendChild(btn);\n      container.appendChild(card);\n    });\n\n    const W = 1280, H = 720;\n    const FRUIT_COLORS = ['#FF6B6B', '#FFD93D', '#9B59B6', '#4D96FF', '#FF8C00', '#6BCB77'];\n    const FRUIT_EMOJIS = ['🍎', '🍌', '🍇', '🫐', '🍊', '🥝'];\n\n    function drawBackground(ctx, type) {\n      const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, W, H);\n      if (type === 'menu') {\n        grad.addColorStop(0, '#667eea'); grad.addColorStop(1, '#764ba2');\n      } else if (type === 'game') {\n        grad.addColorStop(0, '#f093fb'); grad.addColorStop(1, '#f5576c');\n      } else if (type === 'map') {\n        grad.addColorStop(0, '#4facfe'); grad.addColorStop(1, '#00f2fe');\n      } else if (type === 'social') {\n        grad.addColorStop(0, '#43e97b'); grad.addColorStop(1, '#38f9d7');\n      } else {\n        grad.addColorStop(0, '#fa709a'); grad.addColorStop(1, '#fee140');\n      }\n      ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);\n    }\n\n    function drawBoard(ctx, ox, oy, cellSize, board) {\n      const N = board.length;\n      // Board background\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.2)';\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.roundRect(ox - 8, oy - 8, N * cellSize + 16, N * cellSize + 16, 12);\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      for (let r = 0; r < N; r++) {\n        for (let c = 0; c < N; c++) {\n          const x = ox + c * cellSize;\n          const y = oy + r * cellSize;\n          const v = board[r][c];\n          if (v < 0) continue;\n          // Cell bg\n          ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.15)';\n          ctx.beginPath();\n          ctx.roundRect(x + 2, y + 2, cellSize - 4, cellSize - 4, 6);\n          ctx.fill();\n          // Fruit\n          ctx.font = `${cellSize * 0.7}px sans-serif`;\n          ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n          ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n          ctx.fillText(FRUIT_EMOJIS[v], x + cellSize / 2, y + cellSize / 2);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    function makeBoard(pattern) {\n      const b = [];\n      for (let r = 0; r < 8; r++) {\n        b[r] = [];\n        for (let c = 0; c < 8; c++) {\n          if (pattern === 'chain' && r >= 2 && r <= 4 && c >= 2 && c <= 5) {\n            b[r][c] = 1; // yellow chain\n          } else {\n            b[r][c] = Math.floor(Math.random() * 6);\n          }\n        }\n      }\n      return b;\n    }\n\n    // Screenshot 1: Main menu\n    function drawS1() {\n      const ctx = document.getElementById('s1').getContext('2d');\n      drawBackground(ctx, 'menu');\n\n      // Title\n      ctx.font = 'bold 80px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.3)';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 4;\n      ctx.strokeText('消消消大作战', W / 2, 160);\n      ctx.fillText('消消消大作战', W / 2, 160);\n\n      ctx.font = '32px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF176';\n      ctx.fillText('Match & Blast', W / 2, 220);\n\n      // Play button\n      const btnW = 300, btnH = 80;\n      const btnX = (W - btnW) / 2, btnY = 320;\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FF6B6B';\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.roundRect(btnX, btnY, btnW, btnH, 40);\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 40px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('开始游戏', W / 2, btnY + 52);\n\n      // Daily bonus\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.roundRect(W / 2 - 140, 440, 280, 50, 25);\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#333';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 24px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('🎁 每日登录奖励', W / 2, 472);\n\n      // Decorative fruits\n      ctx.font = '60px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('🍎', 120, 500);\n      ctx.fillText('🍌', 1050, 450);\n      ctx.fillText('🍇', 200, 350);\n      ctx.fillText('🫐', 1000, 300);\n      ctx.fillText('🍊', 150, 200);\n      ctx.fillText('🥝', 1100, 200);\n\n      // Rating stars\n      ctx.font = '36px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐', W / 2, 560);\n\n      // Bottom\n      ctx.font = '20px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.6)';\n      ctx.fillText('超过100万玩家正在玩', W / 2, 620);\n    }\n\n    // Screenshot 2: Core gameplay\n    function drawS2() {\n      const ctx = document.getElementById('s2').getContext('2d');\n      drawBackground(ctx, 'game');\n\n      const board = makeBoard('normal');\n      const cellSize = 60;\n      const boardW = 8 * cellSize;\n      const ox = (W - boardW) / 2;\n      const oy = 120;\n      drawBoard(ctx, ox, oy, cellSize, board);\n\n      // HUD\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 28px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n      ctx.fillText('关卡 12', 40, 50);\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillText('分数: 3,250', W / 2, 50);\n      ctx.textAlign = 'right';\n      ctx.fillText('剩余步数: 15', W - 40, 50);\n\n      // Target\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.font = '24px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF176';\n      ctx.fillText('目标: 达到 5,000 分', W / 2, 90);\n\n      // Swipe hint arrow\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n      ctx.setLineDash([8, 4]);\n      const arrowX = ox + 2.5 * cellSize + cellSize / 2;\n      const arrowY = oy + 4.5 * cellSize + cellSize / 2;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(arrowX, arrowY);\n      ctx.lineTo(arrowX + cellSize, arrowY);\n      ctx.stroke();\n      ctx.setLineDash([]);\n\n      // Bottom buttons\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.2)';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(W / 2 - 250, 650, 120, 45, 22); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(W / 2 - 60, 650, 120, 45, 22); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(W / 2 + 130, 650, 120, 45, 22); ctx.fill();\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = '20px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('💡 提示', W / 2 - 190, 678);\n      ctx.fillText('🔄 重排', W / 2, 678);\n      ctx.fillText('➕ 加步', W / 2 + 190, 678);\n    }\n\n    // Screenshot 3: Chain reaction\n    function drawS3() {\n      const ctx = document.getElementById('s3').getContext('2d');\n      drawBackground(ctx, 'combo');\n\n      const board = makeBoard('chain');\n      const cellSize = 60;\n      const boardW = 8 * cellSize;\n      const ox = (W - boardW) / 2;\n      const oy = 100;\n      drawBoard(ctx, ox, oy, cellSize, board);\n\n      // Chain text\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 48px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.4)';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n      ctx.strokeText('3x 连锁！', W / 2, 620);\n      ctx.fillText('3x 连锁！', W / 2, 620);\n\n      // Score popup\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 36px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('+1,500 分', W / 2, 670);\n\n      // Sparkle effects around chain area\n      ctx.font = '30px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('✨', ox + 1 * cellSize, oy + 3 * cellSize);\n      ctx.fillText('✨', ox + 6 * cellSize, oy + 2 * cellSize);\n      ctx.fillText('💥', ox + 3 * cellSize, oy + 4 * cellSize + 30);\n\n      // Combo multiplier badge\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FF6B6B';\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.arc(W - 100, 60, 45, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 28px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('x2', W - 100, 68);\n    }\n\n    // Screenshot 4: Map screen\n    function drawS4() {\n      const ctx = document.getElementById('s4').getContext('2d');\n      drawBackground(ctx, 'map');\n\n      // Path\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 6;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      const path = [\n        [200, 600], [300, 520], [400, 480], [500, 400], [600, 350],\n        [700, 300], [800, 250], [900, 200], [1000, 180],\n      ];\n      ctx.moveTo(path[0][0], path[0][1]);\n      path.forEach(p => ctx.lineTo(p[0], p[1]));\n      ctx.stroke();\n\n      // Level nodes\n      const levels = [\n        { x: 200, y: 600, star: 3, done: true },\n        { x: 350, y: 500, star: 2, done: true },\n        { x: 500, y: 400, star: 3, done: true },\n        { x: 650, y: 320, star: 1, done: true },\n        { x: 800, y: 250, star: 0, done: false, current: true },\n        { x: 950, y: 190, star: 0, done: false, locked: true },\n        { x: 1080, y: 220, star: 0, done: false, locked: true },\n      ];\n\n      levels.forEach((lv, i) => {\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(lv.x, lv.y, 28, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n\n        if (lv.locked) {\n          ctx.fillStyle = '#666';\n        } else if (lv.current) {\n          ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n        } else {\n          ctx.fillStyle = '#6BCB77';\n        }\n        ctx.fill();\n        ctx.strokeStyle = '#FFF';\n        ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n        ctx.stroke();\n\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n        ctx.font = 'bold 20px sans-serif';\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n        ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n        if (lv.locked) {\n          ctx.fillText('🔒', lv.x, lv.y);\n        } else {\n          ctx.fillText(`${i + 1}`, lv.x, lv.y);\n        }\n\n        if (lv.star > 0) {\n          ctx.font = '16px sans-serif';\n          ctx.fillText('⭐'.repeat(lv.star), lv.x, lv.y + 40);\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Title\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 40px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.textBaseline = 'alphabetic';\n      ctx.fillText('冒险地图', W / 2, 80);\n\n      // Coins\n      ctx.font = '24px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n      ctx.fillText('🪙 1,250', 40, 50);\n    }\n\n    // Screenshot 5: Social PK\n    function drawS5() {\n      const ctx = document.getElementById('s5').getContext('2d');\n      drawBackground(ctx, 'social');\n\n      // Title\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 40px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillText('好友 PK', W / 2, 60);\n\n      // VS layout\n      // Player 1\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.15)';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(40, 100, 540, 500, 16); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 32px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('你', 310, 160);\n      ctx.font = 'bold 60px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('😎', 310, 250);\n\n      // Player 1 score\n      ctx.font = 'bold 48px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n      ctx.fillText('4 / 5', 310, 340);\n\n      // Player 1 progress bar\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.2)';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(140, 370, 340, 20, 10); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#6BCB77';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(140, 370, 340 * 0.8, 20, 10); ctx.fill();\n\n      // VS badge\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FF6B6B';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(W / 2, 350, 50, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 36px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('VS', W / 2, 360);\n\n      // Player 2\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.15)';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(700, 100, 540, 500, 16); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = 'bold 32px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('好友', 970, 160);\n      ctx.font = 'bold 60px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('🤗', 970, 250);\n\n      ctx.font = 'bold 48px sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n      ctx.fillText('3 / 5', 970, 340);\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.2)';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(800, 370, 340, 20, 10); ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FF6B6B';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(800, 370, 340 * 0.6, 20, 10); ctx.fill();\n\n      // Bottom\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFF';\n      ctx.font = '24px \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif';\n      ctx.fillText('🎉 你赢了！获得 50 金币 + 20 PK积分', W / 2, 660);\n    }\n\n    function downloadCanvas(canvas, label) {\n      const link = document.createElement('a');\n      link.download = `${label}.png`;\n      link.href = canvas.toDataURL('image/png');\n      link.click();\n    }\n\n    function downloadAll() {\n      SHOTS.forEach(shot => {\n        const canvas = document.getElementById(shot.id);\n        downloadCanvas(canvas, shot.label);\n      });\n    }\n\n    // Generate all screenshots\n    drawS1();\n    drawS2();\n    drawS3();\n    drawS4();\n    drawS5();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_19959a1e665546ce8e6b1fe2","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\privacy-policy.html (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05b3e228-d28c-4e13-abc4-e1f635ffca3b","uuid":"dd763160-3f0a-4e6c-aabc-af93a22cbad2","timestamp":"2026-05-23T00:33:51.113Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"D:\\game-projects\\douyin-match3\\privacy-policy.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>隐私政策 — 消消消大作战</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n      max-width: 800px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 20px;\n      background: #FFF8E7;\n      color: #333;\n      line-height: 1.8;\n    }\n    h1 { color: #D32F2F; text-align: center; font-size: 28px; }\n    h2 { color: #E53935; border-bottom: 2px solid #FFCDD2; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px; }\n    .update-date { text-align: center; color: #666; margin: 10px 0 30px; }\n    p { margin: 12px 0; }\n    ul { margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 24px; }\n    li { margin: 6px 0; }\n    .contact { background: #FFF3E0; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 20px; }\n    .footer { text-align: center; color: #999; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EEE; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>消消消大作战 隐私政策</h1>\n  <p class=\"update-date\">更新日期：2026年5月23日 | 生效日期：2026年5月23日</p>\n\n  <p>欢迎您使用「消消消大作战」（以下简称\"本游戏\"）。我们深知个人信息对您的重要性，将以高度审慎的态度对待您的个人信息。本隐私政策将帮助您了解以下内容：</p>\n\n  <h2>一、我们收集的信息</h2>\n  <p>本游戏仅在您明确同意的情况下收集以下信息：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>设备信息</strong>：设备型号、操作系统版本，用于兼容性适配</li>\n    <li><strong>游戏数据</strong>：关卡进度、分数、金币，存储于您的设备本地（localStorage）</li>\n    <li><strong>广告数据</strong>：广告展示频率数据，由穿山甲SDK按其隐私政策独立处理</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p><strong>我们不收集</strong>：真实姓名、身份证号、手机号、通讯录、位置信息、照片。</p>\n\n  <h2>二、信息的使用</h2>\n  <p>我们收集的信息仅用于以下目的：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>提供游戏服务、保存您的游戏进度</li>\n    <li>优化游戏体验和性能</li>\n    <li>展示广告（由第三方广告平台提供）</li>\n    <li>保障游戏公平性和安全性</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>三、信息的存储</h2>\n  <p>您的游戏进度数据存储在您的设备本地（localStorage），不会上传至我们的服务器。当您清除本地缓存时，游戏进度可能丢失。</p>\n\n  <h2>四、第三方服务</h2>\n  <p>本游戏集成了以下第三方服务：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>穿山甲广告SDK</strong>：由字节跳动提供，用于展示广告。穿山甲SDK可能收集设备标识符用于广告投放。详情请参阅 <a href=\"https://www.csjplatform.com/privacy\">穿山甲隐私政策</a></li>\n    <li><strong>抖音开放平台</strong>：用于社交分享和好友互动功能</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>五、信息的共享</h2>\n  <p>我们不会将您的个人信息出售、交易或以其他方式转让给第三方，以下情况除外：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>获得您的明确同意后</li>\n    <li>根据法律法规或政府要求</li>\n    <li>与上述第三方服务提供者共享（仅限于提供服务所必需的信息）</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>六、您的权利</h2>\n  <p>您享有以下权利：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>查阅</strong>：您可以随时在游戏设置中查看本地存储的数据</li>\n    <li><strong>删除</strong>：您可以清除本地缓存来删除所有游戏数据</li>\n    <li><strong>撤回同意</strong>：您可以在系统设置中关闭广告个性化推荐</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>七、未成年人保护</h2>\n  <p>本游戏适合全年龄段用户。我们高度重视未成年人的个人信息保护：</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>如您的年龄不满14周岁，请在监护人指导下阅读本政策</li>\n    <li>我们不会主动收集未成年人的个人敏感信息</li>\n    <li>监护人有权查阅、更正或删除未成年人的游戏数据</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>八、隐私政策的更新</h2>\n  <p>我们可能会不时更新本隐私政策。更新后的政策将在游戏内或本页面公布。重大变更将通过弹窗等方式通知您。</p>\n\n  <h2>九、联系我们</h2>\n  <div class=\"contact\">\n    <p>如您对本隐私政策有任何疑问、意见或建议，请通过以下方式联系我们：</p>\n    <p>电子邮箱：privacy@example.com</p>\n    <p>我们将在15个工作日内回复您的请求。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <p>消消消大作战（Match & Blast）&copy; 2026</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
